      "value": "@{64ddbc382568fe65999835e8|full_name} @{64ddb804fdd61ba6bcd49a7f|full_name}: Absolutely agreed on all points. I do want to make it crystal clear that this is the eyetracking mode for ***standalone*** Quest Pro, as in, running VRChat on the Quest Pro's hardware and using the eyetracking natively without connecting to a PC.\n\nYou can still do eyetracking via OSC using the Quest Pro connected to PC, which is what the vaaaaaaaaaast majority of users employing this tech do.\n\nIf I could put more \"aaaa\"s in that word without being annoying to illustrate how many more users I'm talking about, I would. 😅",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
